1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,700
Blue cheese gnocchi for two.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,500
Start with a leek, chopped fine.

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,000
Then an onion, sliced thin.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,000
Green pepper goes into the hot pan first.

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,500
Now the onion joins it.

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:24,000
Cook slowly until it is soft and sweet.

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,000
Set it aside on a plate.

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:32,000
Pour in the cream and let it warm up gently.

9
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:37,000
Stir in the blue cheese until it melts.

10
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:42,000
Meanwhile, boil the
gnocchi for just a minute.

11
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:47,000
Bring the soft veg back
into the creamy sauce.

12
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:51,000
Tip the cherry tomatoes into the sauce.

13
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:54,000
Drain the gnocchi well.

14
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:59,000
Add the gnocchi to the sauce
and mix it all together.

15
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:02,500
Give it a good stir.

16
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:07,500
Plate it up while it is nice and hot.

17
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,500
Finish with grated Gruyère.

18
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:14,000
And that's it. Ready to eat.

19
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Total €9.70, €4.85 a serving. Follow for more.
